Now append update/effects methods. Replace final `}` again with methods.

Need `update(dt, catX, catY, mode)`? Main calls world.update(dt, catX, cameraX) plus effects. Signature: update(dt, catX, camX). It handles animations, generation, supernova timer, cleanup, dust, effects.

Methods:

```js
update(dt, catX, camX) {
  this.time += dt;
  this.generateAhead(catX + 150);
  this.updateBackground(camX);
  this._updatePickups(dt);
  this._updateObstacles(dt);
  this._updateAmbient(dt);
  this._updateEffects(dt);
  this._updateSupernova(dt, catX);
  this.cleanupTimer -= dt;
  if (this.cleanupTimer <= 0) { this.cleanupTimer = 0.5; this._cleanup(catX); }
}
```

_updateSupernova handles timer + visual.
onEvent callback passes 'surge' when timer triggers. Also start warning? At timer 2.5s before event, show "SUPERNOVA CHARGING"? Could emit event 'charge' once. Add this.chargeNotified boolean. Simpler: emit 'surge' at trigger only. Banner enough.

Visual supernova: pulse scale; eventPulse decays. Also ring rotate.

_updatePickups: for each p: p.phase += dt; group.position.y = baseY + sin(time*2.2+phase)*.13; if coin mesh.rotation.y += dt*3.2; crystal rotation.y += dt*1.8; rotation.x += dt*.7; flash: mesh.rotation.y += dt*1.5; ring rotate; glow scale = base * (1 + sin*0.1). Need base glow scale stored? p.glow.scale set initially; animate multiply using base constants. Store p.glowBase = scale. Add to addPickup? I didn't store. Compute from kind: flash 3.6, crystal 2.4, coin 1.8. Use `const gb = ...`.

_updateObstacles: orb bob group.position.y = baseY + sin(time*2.4+phase)*.18; ring child rotation.z? Find children[1] maybe. Simpler rotate group.rotation.z small? That rotates whole orb+ring, fine but sprite unaffected. Use group.rotation.y += dt*.8. Spike no anim.

_updateAmbient: dust positions drift. Access geometry attribute array. For each d: d.y += dt*(0.25+d.s*.5); d.x += sin(time*.5+d.p)*dt*.15; if d.y > 15 d.y=-6; positions. Also stars twinkle material opacity = .65+.15*sin(time*2). Backdrop maybe slight. Cat light follows catX.

_updateEffects: bursts & rings.

_updateSupernova: timer; if <=0 → spawn trail, event; also screen ring. `this.onEvent('surge')`; flash overlay handled main. Visual: snGlow opacity, core scale. eventPulse decays at .5/s.

cleanup: filter platforms (x1 < catX-35), obstacles (x < catX-30), pickups (x < catX-30), islands (x < catX-50). Remove groups from scene. For pickups maybe alive false removed already.

collectNear(x,y,radius):
Loop and use pickup group position. Return collected array. Note pickups array reassignment; main will read each frame fresh. Filter after loop.

Also `hitObstacle(box)` returns first hit. Orb collision uses group.position.y.

`novaBlast(catX)` as planned.

`platformAt(x)`.

`burst(x,y,color,count,size)`.

`shockwave`.

Need color handling in burst: set sprite material color. `new THREE.Color(color)` or setHex.

